## Tecnologías

| Capa | Tecnología |
|------|------------|
| Frontend | Angular 17, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS |
| Backend | Node.js, Express 4 |
| Base de datos | MongoDB Atlas + Mongoose |
| Auth | JWT + bcryptjs |
| Testing | Jest + Supertest |
| Dev tools | Nodemon, Concurrently |

---

## Rutas del Frontend

| Ruta | Componente | Protegida |
|------|------------|-----------|
| `/` | HomeComponent | No |
| `/proyectos` | ProjectsComponent | No |
| `/proyectos/:id` | ProjectDetailComponent | No |
| `/publicar` | PublishProjectComponent | Si |
| `/login` | LoginComponent | No |
| `/registro` | RegisterComponent | No |
| `/quejas-reclamos` | ReclamosComponent | Si |
| `/quienes-somos` | AboutComponent | No |
| `/admin` | AdminComponent | Admin |
| `/**` | NotFoundComponent | No |
